  lines:
  - speakerName: Guide
    text: "Both ends are crimped, and the finished cable is now on the workbench. Pick it up."
  - speakerName: Guide
    text: "A crimped cable isn't finished until it has been tested. Take it to the cable tester and plug it in - it checks all eight wires and shows you if any are out of place."
